window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1453\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1453\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1476\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδόξημα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Desonra, ignomínia.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1454\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1454\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1477\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδοξία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Má reputação, descrédito; obscuridade; desprezo.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1455\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1455\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1478\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδοξοποίητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que não forma opiniões ou juízos; destituído de raciocínio deliberativo.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1456\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1456\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1479\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδοξος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sem glória, inglório; desonroso; obscuro, de condição humilde; desprezado; inesperado ou improvável.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1457\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1457\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1480\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδορος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Não esfolado; como substantivo, pele ou couro, conforme as equivalências da fonte.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1458\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1458\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1481\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδορπος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sem alimento, em jejum.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1459\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1459\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1482\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδορυφόρητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sem guarda-costas.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1460\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1460\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1483\"><td class=\"greek\">ἅδος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Saciedade, fastio, repugnância; primeiro homógrafo.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1461\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1461\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1484\"><td class=\"greek\">ἅδος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Decreto, determinação; segundo homógrafo distinto.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1462\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1462\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1485\"><td class=\"greek\">ἇδος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma dórica relacionada a ἧδος e ἡδοσύνη, prazer ou deleite.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1463\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1463\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1486\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδοτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sem presentes, que não recebeu dádivas.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1464\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1464\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1487\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδουλαγώγητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Não escravizado, não reduzido à escravidão.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1465\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1465\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1488\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδούλευτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Pessoa que jamais foi escrava.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1466\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1466\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1489\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδουλέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Não possuir escravos.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1467\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1467\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1490\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδουλία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Condição de não ter escravos, ausência de escravos.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1468\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1468\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1491\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄδουλος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Não servido ou acompanhado por escravos; sem recursos para manter escravos; avesso à escravidão.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1469\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1469\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1492\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδούλωτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Não escravizado, não subjugado; não dominado pelo prazer.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1470\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1470\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1493\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδούπητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Silencioso, sem ruído.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1471\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1471\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1494\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδουσιασάμενοι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosas de Hesíquio: ἀδουσιασάμενοι, «tendo concordado»; ἀδούσιον, «agradável, conforme».</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1472\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1472\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1495\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδραία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma macedônica ἀδραία equivalente a αἰθρία («céu claro»); a fonte registra também ἀδρακής equivalente a ἀδερκής.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1473\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1473\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1496\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδράνεια</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Falta de vigor, fraqueza, prostração; falta de eficácia.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1474\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1474\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1497\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδράνεος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma equivalente a ἀδρανής: fraco, sem vigor.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1475\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1475\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1498\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδρανέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Ser fraco, perder a força, também dito da luz das estrelas.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1476\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1476\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1499\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδρανής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Impotente, fraco, débil; ineficiente; irreal; menos eficaz; privado de sua força, inútil.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1477\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1477\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1500\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀδρανίζομαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Equivalente a ἀδρανέω: ser fraco, debilitar-se.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
